  "description": "This WindowSill extension allows to control your Microsoft Teams meeting even when it is in background or minimized. When you are in a call, WindowSill will display buttons to mute/unmute yourself along with leaving a call. These buttons are working even when Microsoft Teams is minimized in Windows.\n        \n        This extension only works with Microsoft Teams for Business. It does not work with Microsoft Teams for consumer.",
